// Package sample is a golden fixture: comparisons written across lines, one of
// them with a comment inside the expression.
package sample

// Reach reports whether x has reached one below the limit, written across
// three lines so that the rewrite site itself spans lines.
func Reach(x, limit int) bool {
	return x >=
		limit-
			1
}

// Inclusive reports whether x is within the limit, with a line comment inside
// the comparison that the flattened copy cannot keep.
func Inclusive(x, limit int) bool {
	return x <= // the limit is inclusive
		limit
}
